"Kate, listen to me," Melindra says, hands fluttering in front of her chest. "First, stay calm. Promise me you will stay calm."

"Fine," Kate says. "I promise."

"Right," Melindra takes a ragged breath. "When we struck our deal in Ollendor, I knew nothing about artificial mages or the Beacon of Hope. I only learned about all that later, listening to you talk around the fire."

