choice("Continue", B3-Ch10c-Phrasing, v_current_scene = B3-Ch10c-Phrasing)


ID: B3-Ch10c-Mommy
TEXT:

 "...Mommy?"

"I suspect you are mocking me, but no, I am not your mother," Meridith says. "You are my sister's son, which makes me your aunt."

"Does this mean you know the fate of my biological parents?" I ask.

"Yes." Meridith dips her chin. "They were executed on Lord Heksol's order for conceiving a hybrid child and fleeing Varathia without authorization."

